# Pairs with BatchAllOrNothingAuthorization: a batch is authorized when any one leg is allowed rather than every leg.

MODULE: BatchAnyLegSuffices
TARGET: BatchAllOrNothingAuthorization
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a batch is authorized when any one leg is allowed rather than every leg
PERTURBS: BatchEvaluate

--- FIND
    /\ LET ok == \A p \in pairs : PointAllowed(c, "Write", p)
--- REPLACE
    /\ LET ok == \E p \in pairs : PointAllowed(c, "Write", p)
--- END
